flowchart LR
  Fleet[Mixed robot fleet] --> Node[FleetOps Node\nARM Linux + adapters]
  Node --> Buffer[(SQLite 72h ring buffer)]
  Node --> MQTT[MQTT TLS 1.3 + mTLS]
  MQTT --> API[NestJS modular monolith]
  API --> TS[(TimescaleDB\nraw telemetry + rollups)]
  API --> Redis[(Redis live state + pub/sub)]
  API --> Audit[(PostgreSQL audit chain)]
  API --> Console[React operational console]
  Console --> Ops[OpsManager / Technician]
  Console --> RaaS[RaaSProvider]
  Console --> Insurer[InsuranceAuditor]
